:"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-04-08T04:28:46Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T15:16:19Z","closed_at":"2026-06-24T15:21:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118294","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118294","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118294.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118294.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-24T15:21:14Z"},"body":"Fix Visual Profiler cursor not appearing when graph is partially filled\r\n\r\n### Issue\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118279\r\n\r\nWhen the Visual Profiler graph is not fully filled, clicking does not show the cursor (vertical line). The cursor appears stuck at the left edge.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Cause\r\n\r\nThe issue was caused by arithmetic involving mixed numeric types.\r\n\r\nframe_metrics[last_metric].frame_number is uint64_t, while max_frames is int. When frame_metrics[last_metric].frame_number is smaller than max_frames, the subtraction produces an incorrect value. This leads to a negative frame index after further calculation, which gets clamped to 0, causing the cursor to appear stuck at the left edge.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Fix\r\n\r\nCast frame_metrics[last_metric].frame_number to int64_t before performing the subtraction:\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nint64_t first_visible_frame = static_cast<int64_t>(frame_metrics[last_metric].frame_number) - max_frames + 1;\r\nint frame = cursor_metric_edit->get_value() - first_visible_frame;\r\n````\r\n\r\nThis ensures correct frame index calculation and proper cursor positioning when the graph is not fully filled.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Notes\r\n\r\nAI-assisted: Used an LLM for initial understanding of the issue. Final solution was validated and refined manually.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.